From 2750049f66bc0a20f149f03002df9734554beed1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ebg-ant <296364998+ebg-ant@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 16:22:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] feat: one window glides as a picture of itself, over the
 real display

With motion on, windowPictures on and a picture to be had, the window an act is about travels as a picture on a small panel; the others
jump in plain view. The real window waits out of view, takes its size there and is placed under the panel at the end. On a Mac the
presenter still says that there is no picture, so nothing changes there yet.
